Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Used to cruise on weekends, friends on the beach\\NNow frustrated drivers fill every side street\\NWhat once was a shortcut is a nightmare now\\NAll for a ribbon and a political vow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Proposition K got it wrong all along\\NWe’re choking on the traffic as the parade rolls on\\NCut off our veins to build their outdoor stage\\NSunset and Richmond are burning with rage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:01:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Too loud too fast can\'t sleep can\'t last\\NToo loud too fast can\'t sleep can\'t last
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:01:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we had peace off the Great Highway\\NNow it\'s gridlock on Tuesday, honking every day\\NEngardio smiled, called it progress for all\\NBut hundreds of neighbors ignore his recall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:01:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No environmental study to say if we’re doomed\\NJust bikes and the blocs—another ballot consumed
